        <div id="cz-conv-modo" style="background:rgba(34,197,94,.1);color:#22c55e;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;margin-bottom:6px;text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px;border:1px solid rgba(34,197,94,.3)">📡 Modo: WATI · janela 24h</div>
